# Documentation Sync

When making code changes, update relevant docs so they stay accurate. Check if any of these need updates:

| Change type | Docs to update |
|-------------|----------------|
| API endpoints, scheduler, backfills | [apps/api/README.md](apps/api/README.md), [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md) |
| Parsers, enrichers, store types | [apps/scraper/README.md](apps/scraper/README.md), [docs/SCRAPING.md](docs/SCRAPING.md) |
| Schema, migrations, brand/taxonomy config | [packages/shared/README.md](packages/shared/README.md), [packages/shared/migrations/README.md](packages/shared/migrations/README.md) |
| Category tree, mappings, LLM classifier | [docs/TAXONOMY.md](docs/TAXONOMY.md), [CLAUDE.md](CLAUDE.md) Architecture section |
| New features, data flow, deployment | [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md), [CLAUDE.md](CLAUDE.md), [README.md](README.md) |

**Before finishing a change:** If you added/removed endpoints, parsers, env vars, or tables — update the corresponding doc.